// EXPECT: [E085]
// A write through a reference must reach the facts about its referent. The octagon's store
// transfer handled stores to an alloca, a field of one and a `var` parameter, and did NOTHING for
// a store through any other pointer — so `r = 200` left `n ∈ [4,4]` and `a[n]` was PROVEN, a read
// of a[200]. ASan did not notice (the read lands 800 bytes past the array, beyond its redzone).
func main() i32 {
    var a i32[5] = [0, 0, 0, 0, 0]
    var n usize = 4
    var r = var n
    r = 200
    return a[n]
}
